	<meta property="og:description" content="This article is about East Supreme Kai. For other character, see East Kai. For the race of beings who held the position, see Supreme Kai (position). For other uses, see Supreme Kai (disambiguation). Directory: Characters → Deities → Supreme Kai Shin (シン, Shin),[3][4] born Nahare (ナハレ, Nahare),[5] is the East Supreme Kai (東ひがしの界かい王おう神しん, Higashi no Kaiōshin, lit. &quot;Eastern God of the Kings of Worlds&quot;) (primarily referred to as just Supreme Kai (界かい王おう神しん, Kaiōshin, lit. &quot;God of the Kings of...">

