	<div class="pi-data-value pi-font"><a href="/wiki/Grand_Supreme_Kai" title="Grand Supreme Kai">Grand Supreme Kai</a><br><a href="/wiki/Old_Kai" title="Old Kai">Old Kai</a></div>
