</aside>

<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p><p><br>
<b>Shin</b><span style="font-weight: normal"> (<span class="t_nihongo_kanji" lang="ja">シン</span><span class="t_nihongo_comma" style="display:none">,</span> <i><span class="t_nihongo_romaji"><i>Shin</i></span></i><span class="t_nihongo_help"></span>)</span>,<sup id="cite_ref-3" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-3"><span class="cite-bracket">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup><sup id="cite_ref-4" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-4"><span class="cite-bracket">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup> born <b>Nahare</b><span style="font-weight: normal"> (<span class="t_nihongo_kanji" lang="ja">ナハレ</span><span class="t_nihongo_comma" style="display:none">,</span> <i><span class="t_nihongo_romaji"><i>Nahare</i></span></i><span class="t_nihongo_help"></span>)</span>,<sup id="cite_ref-DBDep7_5-0" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-DBDep7-5"><span class="cite-bracket">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket">]</span></a></sup> is the <b>East Supreme Kai</b><span style="font-weight: normal"> (<span class="t_nihongo_kanji" lang="ja"><ruby>東<rt>ひがし</rt></ruby>の<ruby>界<rt>かい</rt></ruby><ruby>王<rt>おう</rt></ruby><ruby>神<rt>しん</rt></ruby></span><span class="t_nihongo_comma" style="display:none">,</span> <i><span class="t_nihongo_romaji"><i>Higashi no Kaiōshin</i></span></i><span class="t_nihongo_help"></span>, lit. "Eastern God of the Kings of Worlds")</span> (primarily referred to as just <b>Supreme Kai</b><span style="font-weight: normal"> (<span class="t_nihongo_kanji" lang="ja"><ruby>界<rt>かい</rt></ruby><ruby>王<rt>おう</rt></ruby><ruby>神<rt>しん</rt></ruby></span><span class="t_nihongo_comma" style="display:none">,</span> <i><span class="t_nihongo_romaji"><i>Kaiōshin</i></span></i><span class="t_nihongo_help"></span>, lit. "God of the Kings of Worlds")</span>). He is the ruler of the eastern area of both the living world and <a href="/wiki/Other_World" title="Other World">Other World</a> in the universe and the <a href="/wiki/Supreme_Kai_(position)" title="Supreme Kai (position)">Supreme Kai</a> of <a href="/wiki/Universe_7" title="Universe 7">Universe 7</a>.
</p>
